cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. This repository is an
  extended fork of hpietukhin/refactoring-with-llms; please also credit the
  original work (see references).
title: "refactoring-with-llms (SEQ-Refactor extended fork)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Maihankali
    given-names: Munura
repository-code: "https://github.com/Maihanks/refactoring-with-llms"
abstract: >-
  An extended fork of refactoring-with-llms that integrates the SEQ-Refactor
  smell-ordering planner alongside the existing DAPS, TopS and BeFS planners,
  together with single-run and repeated planner comparison experiments on tap4j.
keywords:
  - refactoring
  - code smells
  - large language models
  - refactoring planning
date-released: "2026-11-16"
